-to-door including GCC customs. Installation is scheduled immediately after delivery.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Do you serve Bahrain's banking and financial sector?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes — fine-pitch LED for lobbies, trading floors and briefing rooms is a core specialism, matching the close-viewing image quality expected in Bahrain Financial Harbour and Diplomatic Area offices. We hold experience with the DIFC financial-district equivalent in Dubai.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How do your screens cope with Bahrain's coastal humidity?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Panels specified for Bahrain use conformal-coated PCBs and corrosion-resistant cabinets to withstand salt-laden coastal air. Outdoor systems carry IP65 protection front and rear with anti-corrosion fasteners and sealed power supplies.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can you support events and exhibitions in Bahrain?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes — rental-spec LED with fast-lock frames and flight-case logistics is available for Bahrain events, exhibitions at BIEC and motorsport hospitality. Crews and equipment mobilise from Dubai within days.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What warranty applies to Bahrain installations?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"The standard 2-year warranty (extendable to 5) applies fully in Bahrain, backed by spare modules left on site and remote diagnostics. Maintenance visits are bundled with our Eastern-Gulf service routes for fast response.\\\"}}]}9:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"main\\\",null,{\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\